DD8C 3606             (    forth6809.asm):05572                     PSHU  D
DD8E BDD905           (    forth6809.asm):05573                     JSR   THROWW
DD91 BDDD4D           (    forth6809.asm):05574         BTOK:       JSR   LITERALW
