                      (    forth6809.asm):10449         ; DOTEST, DOPLUSTEST, QDOSETUP, EXITUNLOOP) or counted string (DOSTR,
                      (    forth6809.asm):10450         ; DOTSTR, DOCSTR, DOABORTQUOTE); DKT lists them. IF ELSE THEN BEGIN
                      (    forth6809.asm):10451         ; UNTIL AGAIN WHILE REPEAT are rebuilt from branch targets by scanning
                      (    forth6809.asm):10452         ; the definition (DQ), so the shape is right but ENDOF and ENDCASE
                      (    forth6809.asm):10453         ; show as ELSE and THEN. A word whose first byte is neither JSR nor RTS
